OP13-Kanji-furigana,Duality,30,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,8,10,10,80,1Style: OP13-Karaoke,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Translation,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Kanji,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,110,1Style: OP13-Credits,FOT-Greco Std B,40,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,95,100,1,0,1,2.2,0,1,80,10,100,1Style: Pekoms - Infobox,Roboto,39,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,2,2,10,10,10,1Style: Map,Roboto,39,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,2,2,10,10,10,1Style: Lyrics Post-War,FOT-Greco Std B,39,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.6,0,2,10,10,15,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, Text﻿[Script Info]; Script generated by Aegisub 3.2.2; http://www.aegisub.org/Title: Default Aegisub fileScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: NonePlayResX: 1280PlayResY: 720Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.10,0:01:55.98,Title,,0,0,250,,Pirates vs. CP9Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.87,0:02:02.08,Main,,0,0,0,,This is probably the place.Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.08,0:02:03.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I finally made it.Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.52,0:02:07.43,Main,,0,0,0,,I had to go up and down all those stairs.Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.97,0:02:09.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.41,0:02:11.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.90,0:02:14.59,Main,,0,0,0,,It's me!Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.44,0:02:17.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.17,0:02:20.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Where are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.97,0:02:23.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.18,0:02:27.08,Main,,0,0,0,,That damn pigeon guy!Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.08,0:02:28.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah...!Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.80,0:02:31.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I know where they're going. Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.72,0:02:36.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I should just head to the Gates of Justice, too! Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.01,0:02:41.05,Main,,0,0,0,,You have the key to Robin's handcuffs, right?Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.05,0:02:43.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Want to give it to me before I take you down?Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.83,0:02:45.81,Main,,0,0,0,,That's a foolish question.Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.81,0:02:49.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I was disappointed that I didn't get to see your real ability...Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.37,0:02:51.54,Main,,0,0,0,,at the Galley-La mansion.Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.54,0:02:55.73,Main,,0,0,0,,I never thought that pirates would come this far, either, so...Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:03:01.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Be careful; I've grown far stronger since then. Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.45,0:03:04.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I can imagine, with all that energy you've got...Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.75,0:03:06.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Energy like that of a beast.Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.71,0:03:09.72,Main,,0,0,0,,What a fearsome man you are.Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.23,0:03:11.92,Main,,0,0,0,,However, Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.74,0:03:16.79,Main,,0,0,0,,my swordsmanship is the best in CP9.Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.79,0:03:18.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me.Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.42,0:03:20.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Two-Sword Style, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.27,0:03:27.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick.Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.02,0:03:40.24,Main,,0,0,0,,So, no... sorry, but I use four swords.Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.24,0:03:41.86,Main,,0,0,0,,No problem.Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.86,0:03:44.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, your entire body is a weapon.Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.67,0:03:59.21,Main,,0,0,0,,72...Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.63,0:04:01.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick. Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.30,0:04:04.34,Main,,0,0,0,,– Pound Phoenix! – White Thunder!Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.35,0:04:09.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Shave!Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.06,0:04:27.07,Main,,0,0,0,,This is fun!Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.42,0:04:33.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to have fun!Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.62,0:04:36.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Then you just have to take me down.Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.08,0:04:40.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick! Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.34,0:04:41.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Tumult! Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.47,0:04:51.84,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He controls these slashing attacks so easily. Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:03.11,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastard... Are you mocking me?Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.66,0:05:06.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa... I'd expect no less from you.Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.07,0:05:08.87,Main,,0,0,0,,If you're in that much of a hurry, I'll show you...Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.04,0:05:12.75,Main,,0,0,0,,my new powers.Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.99,0:05:34.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh... What the hell?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.94,0:05:47.53,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,At any rate, what the heck is this room?Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.53,0:05:51.25,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Someone really went nuts on the gardening. Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.25,0:05:53.12,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,This is practically outside!Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.83,0:05:54.64,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,No, no...Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.64,0:05:57.21,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,More importantly, I have to get the key to Robin's handcuffs right now!Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.84,0:05:59.49,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,That key...!Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.04,0:06:03.49,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Quietly... Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.49,0:06:05.09,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Quietly... Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.30,0:06:08.79,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Don't hesitate! Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.14,0:06:12.77,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,If I quietly grab it,Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.77,0:06:15.56,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,then quietly run away...Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.56,0:06:17.95,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'll accomplish my mission.Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.95,0:06:20.02,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It'll be a flawless victory! Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.02,0:06:21.29,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,That's right.Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.29,0:06:25.11,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'm the king of being lucky! Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.24,0:06:37.25,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'm almost there!Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:44.21,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,A-A rooster?! Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.21,0:06:48.88,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! What is the noisiest bird of them all doing here?Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.94,0:06:51.92,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.92,0:06:53.31,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,If it crows, it's all over!Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.31,0:06:56.14,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,If it crows, he'll get up, find me, and kill me!Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.33,0:06:57.07,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Hey. Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.07,0:06:58.40,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What're you looking at?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.40,0:06:59.54,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to crow?Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.54,0:07:01.27,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Are you?! Are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.27,0:07:03.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Shhh! Shhh!Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.61,0:07:06.22,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Rooster-kun! Rooster-san! Rooster-sama! I beg you! Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.22,0:07:07.84,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Please don't crow!Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.84,0:07:11.25,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Don't crow! Don't! Please don't! Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.03,0:07:14.45,Main,,0,0,0,,No rooster would crow like that!Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.50,0:07:17.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're here, pirate.Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.29,0:07:20.62,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Th-That damn rooster!Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.62,0:07:23.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it's time I give you a beatdown. Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.08,0:07:24.92,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,That damn rooster!Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:39.18,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,H-He's strong...Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.20,0:07:43.10,Main,,0,0,0,,So you're the one who came?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.79,0:07:47.54,Main,,0,0,0,,You're the one who shot through the government flag, right?Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.79,0:07:50.66,Note,,0,0,0,,Jug reads "Liquor".Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.14,0:07:54.02,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems that you're a skilled sniper. Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.29,0:08:01.16,Main,,0,0,0,,He delivered a punch like that right after he woke up?Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.16,0:08:04.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry for attacking you half-assed.Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.02,0:08:05.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.77,0:08:08.42,Main,,0,0,0,,It must've hurt.Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.11,0:08:17.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.89,0:08:19.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.93,0:08:23.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I may not look like it, but I'm not into tormenting my opponent.Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.95,0:08:27.02,Main,,0,0,0,,A-A devil fruit...!Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.02,0:08:29.98,Main,,0,0,0,,The Dog Dog Fruit, Model: Wolf! Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.55,0:08:33.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll just tear out your windpipe and that'll be it. Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.25,0:08:34.73,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll die anyway.Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.73,0:08:37.31,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't have to suffer.Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.31,0:08:38.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.22,0:08:40.71,Main,,0,0,0,,W-Wolf...!Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.31,0:08:44.67,Main,,0,0,0,,D-Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.47,0:08:47.52,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Are you gonna fight?Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.52,0:08:49.42,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't look strong, though.Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.97,0:08:53.39,Main,,0,0,0,,S-Strong or not, I'm gonna fight!Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.88,0:08:55.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.25,0:08:58.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I came to rescue Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.61,0:09:02.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa! The ceiling is...Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.62,0:09:04.56,Main,,0,0,0,,collapsing!Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.90,0:09:07.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, shoot!Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:09.57,Main,,0,0,0,,I was gonna stop the transformation...Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.57,0:09:11.61,Main,,0,0,0,,when I reached my hybrid form, but I became a giraffe! Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.61,0:09:15.07,Main,,0,0,0,,A talking giraffe is falling toward us! Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.67,0:09:17.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Kaku!Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.63,0:09:20.58,Main,,0,0,0,,That power of yours is too cool!Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.58,0:09:21.84,Main,,0,0,0,,A wolf?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.84,0:09:24.41,Main,,0,0,0,,What is this place?! A zoo?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.67,0:09:36.22,Main,,0,0,0,,The Ox Ox Fruit, Model: Giraffe! Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.73,0:09:39.66,Main,,0,0,0,,You poor guy!Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.66,0:09:41.97,Main,,0,0,0,,To think that you'll be a giraffe man for the rest of your life!Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.82,0:09:46.07,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with giraffes?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.07,0:09:48.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I said I like it!Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.20,0:09:53.00,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,That pigeon guy was a leopard, wasn't he?Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.00,0:09:56.36,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,There are two more ability users who transform into animals... Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.71,0:10:00.07,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Is CP9 that kind of group?Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.21,0:10:05.77,Main,,0,0,0,,S-So they are zoan-type ability users?Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.77,0:10:07.70,Main,,0,0,0,,A wolf man and a giraffe man...Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.70,0:10:09.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I got stuck with a scary one! Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.35,0:10:14.16,Main,,0,0,0,,But Zoro falling with that giraffe saved me. Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.16,0:10:16.21,Main,,0,0,0,,While it appears to be a two-versus-two fight,Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.97,0:10:18.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll just wait for Zoro to do most of the work.Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.24,0:10:21.36,Main,,0,0,0,,What's that?Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.36,0:10:23.85,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks like a safe with the door left opened.Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.85,0:10:24.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa!Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.77,0:10:27.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Could those weird-looking handcuffs be...?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.91,0:10:30.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I said don't laugh!Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.90,0:10:32.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, giraffe!Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.37,0:10:35.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Just how long are you gonna stand there arguing with him?Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.74,0:10:38.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought I told you that I don't have much time.Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.80,0:10:43.33,Main,,0,0,0,,If you wanna keep arguing, I'll just cut you down where you stand.Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.33,0:10:48.25,Main,,0,0,0,,How foolish... Don't underestimate a giraffe's limitless destructive power.Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.71,0:10:51.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Transform...Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.08,0:10:52.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Hybrid Form! Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.05,0:10:55.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll show you... Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.43,0:10:59.53,Main,,0,0,0,,the power of my transformation!Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.59,0:11:13.00,Main,,0,0,0,,How lame!Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.00,0:11:13.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Gasp!Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.99,0:11:15.90,Main,,0,0,0,,What'd you just...?Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.17,0:11:23.21,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Why'd I blurt something like that out?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.21,0:11:24.04,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have said that. Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.04,0:11:26.87,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I was so shocked that I just blurted it out! Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.87,0:11:29.20,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Don't lose your composure, Zoro! It will dull your blades! Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.19,0:11:34.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Just how long are you gonna keep laughing, Jabra?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.45,0:11:36.82,Main,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry.Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.75,0:11:39.92,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,In any case, he looks funny. Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.92,0:11:42.68,Main,,0,0,0,,How the hell does this form reflect his square features? Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.86,0:11:48.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What're these handcuffs?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.16,0:11:49.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Ahhh!Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.95,0:11:52.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Shoot! I'm sorry, Zoro-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:54.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! What're you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.26,0:11:59.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-They're probably seastone handcuffs just like Robin's! Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.22,0:12:01.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Since our enemies are both devil fruit ability users.Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.95,0:12:04.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought they'd be weaker if they were handcuffed with them! Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.82,0:12:08.12,Main,,0,0,0,,So why are they on me, you idiot?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.40,0:12:09.98,Main,,0,0,0,,B-Because...Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.00,0:12:15.50,Main,,0,0,0,,the giraffe's face is so funny that I just lost my grip.Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.46,0:12:19.08,Main,,0,0,0,,A giraffe with square everything... Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.72,0:12:22.31,Main,,0,0,0,,He's right!Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.01,0:12:26.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn all of you! Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.48,0:12:32.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Taste the power of an ability user! Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.69,0:12:34.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick!Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.36,0:12:40.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What's that?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.72,0:12:42.19,Main,,0,0,0,,He's gonna do something!Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.56,0:12:45.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Sky Slicer!Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.32,0:12:50.28,Main,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.96,0:12:52.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Duck, Usopp!Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.90,0:13:16.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I see...Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.97,0:13:19.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Your strength is in your length— in other words, your reach. Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.03,0:13:23.11,Main,,0,0,0,,With the power coming from that huge body and the centrifugal force, Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.11,0:13:26.08,Main,,0,0,0,,your attacks are deeper and sharper than before. Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.91,0:13:31.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the heck?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.84,0:13:33.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, I don't see any damage.Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.87,0:13:35.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at the ceiling.Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.67,0:13:38.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? The ceiling?Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.88,0:13:39.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh?Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.17,0:13:41.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I can see the blue sky.Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.30,0:13:44.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa...Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.89,0:13:46.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder why... Hm...?Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.98,0:13:51.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me the Tower of Justice has been cut in two! Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.02,0:13:53.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey...!Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.72,0:13:54.96,Main,,0,0,0,,This is dangerous!Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.38,0:13:57.85,Main,,0,0,0,,How shameful!Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.86,0:14:00.64,Main,,0,0,0,,You betrayed your emotions during a battle! Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.64,0:14:02.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up.Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.13,0:14:04.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I like being a giraffe.Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.48,0:14:06.65,Main,,0,0,0,,I love giraffes.Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.97,0:14:09.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.37,0:14:13.11,Main,,0,0,0,,No matter how sharp your attacks are, Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.11,0:14:16.45,Main,,0,0,0,,they won't intimidate me at all. Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.79,0:14:20.28,Main,,0,0,0,,S-Stop it, Zoro!Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.28,0:14:21.88,Main,,0,0,0,,That hurts! What're you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.20,0:14:24.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you pulling my arm?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.09,0:14:27.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh...? Pulling my arm?Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.20,0:14:36.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa! It's locked tight!Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.27,0:14:38.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! What're you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.55,0:14:40.48,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault, is it?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:43.44,Main,,0,0,0,,This happened because you charged at me!Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.44,0:14:46.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I did that because you were standing there in a daze when he attacked!Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.68,0:14:48.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Just unlock these handcuffs!Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.93,0:14:55.37,Main,,0,0,0,,What're these guys doing? Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.03,0:14:57.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Beats me.Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.36,0:14:59.97,Main,,0,0,0,,To put it simply,Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.97,0:15:03.37,Main,,0,0,0,,this means that we're in the same situation as Robin is.Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.37,0:15:04.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, the key is...Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.63,0:15:06.96,Main,,0,0,0,,in the hands of one of the CP9 members.Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.96,0:15:08.63,Main,,0,0,0,,We have no choice but to beat them and get their keys. Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.63,0:15:11.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be absurd! There's no way we can fight like this! Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.96,0:15:14.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Our prey are locked together. Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.34,0:15:16.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay then, Jabra.Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.03,0:15:19.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Just stand back and leave these two to me. Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.64,0:15:24.15,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Are you trying to snatch my prey?! Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.15,0:15:27.86,Main,,0,0,0,,So, do you want to work together and fight them?Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.66,0:15:30.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I'd rather die. Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.31,0:15:31.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Me, too. Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.45,0:15:32.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you two!Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.36,0:15:35.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Tell us the number on those handcuffs.Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.04,0:15:36.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Number?Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.53,0:15:40.88,Main,,0,0,0,,The handcuffs and the keys have numbersDialogue: 0,0:15:40.88,0:15:44.20,Main,,0,0,0,,so that we know which key unlocks which handcuffs.Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.20,0:15:46.87,Main,,0,0,0,,If those handcuffs can be unlocked by one of the keys we have,Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.87,0:15:48.44,Main,,0,0,0,,we'll unlock them right away.Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.44,0:15:50.13,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Really?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.48,0:15:51.63,Main,,0,0,0,,The number... where's the number?Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.07,0:15:53.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Here it is! It's 2!Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.85,0:15:55.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Unlock them! Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.44,0:15:57.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Not the right one.Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.78,0:15:59.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Mine isn't, either.Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.47,0:16:00.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry.Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.31,0:16:03.21,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! You got my hopes up, you jerks!Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.21,0:16:04.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.51,0:16:07.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, it means one of the other three CP9 members has the right one, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.56,0:16:10.15,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess we have no choice. Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.67,0:16:12.91,Main,,0,0,0,,The first one to get a kill wins. Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.91,0:16:14.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Seems like that's the only way.Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.82,0:16:16.66,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.22,0:16:21.80,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.79,0:16:27.67,Captions,,1030,0,370,,Tower of Justice Inner ChamberDialogue: 0,0:16:28.33,0:16:30.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What's with these stairs?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.24,0:16:33.17,Main,,0,0,0,,They're sliced in two and out of place. Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.46,0:16:38.78,Main,,0,0,0,,The impact from earlier...Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.78,0:16:41.48,Main,,0,0,0,,As I suspected, something must've happened.Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.48,0:16:43.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this building okay?Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.02,0:16:54.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Are you okay?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.57,0:17:05.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah! Zoro! Sogeking!Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.33,0:17:09.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah! Hey! Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.05,0:17:13.45,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What's going on? They're waving to me.Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.45,0:17:15.07,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It looks kinda fun.Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.42,0:17:18.30,Main,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, guys!Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.14,0:17:22.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.18,0:17:23.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at the handcuffs! Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.88,0:17:26.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Find the key for the no. 2 handcuffs! Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.28,0:17:29.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? A key?Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.77,0:17:37.41,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.78,0:17:41.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I just assumed that there'd be a bridge or something.Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.62,0:17:45.29,Main,,0,0,0,,What crazy huge whirlpools! Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.90,0:17:48.09,Main,,0,0,0,,I can see the Gates of Justice now,Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.09,0:17:50.17,Main,,0,0,0,,but is it possible to get there on a regular boat? Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.92,0:17:52.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Whatever. I don't have much time. Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.77,0:17:54.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll try something.Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.84,0:17:56.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Here we go!Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.05,0:17:59.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Just wait, Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.64,0:18:03.85,Main,,0,0,0,,I see.Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.47,0:18:07.06,Main,,0,0,0,,So the handcuffs and the keys have numbers on them.Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.83,0:18:08.72,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.72,0:18:10.55,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,That's what's happening here?Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.55,0:18:12.27,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Then I'll fight these guys! Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.60,0:18:13.76,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous!Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.76,0:18:16.53,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,There are two of them!  If you get taken out,Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.53,0:18:19.61,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,with these handcuffs on, we're dead for sure! Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.61,0:18:22.66,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Please! You're our only hope!Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.66,0:18:24.06,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Hope?Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.06,0:18:26.70,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,It's not like I'm happy to hear that, you jerk!Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.12,0:18:29.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Sanji, Nami, and Franky...Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.10,0:18:33.21,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,If any of them get the no. 2 key, bring it straight to us! Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.21,0:18:34.94,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you!Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.94,0:18:38.63,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,The one who's likely to get the key first is... maybe Sanji?Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.40,0:18:43.18,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'll go look for Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.45,0:18:45.10,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'm their only hope!Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.11,0:18:57.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Now...Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.49,0:19:02.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I've got you! Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.49,0:19:03.20,Captions,,0,920,340,,Level 0  Isolated Corridor Nami vs. KumadoriDialogue: 0,0:19:03.77,0:19:04.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me go!Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.95,0:19:09.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Yoyoi! Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.21,0:19:11.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Just...Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.84,0:19:15.21,Main,,0,0,0,,give up!Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.08,0:19:18.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Die!Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.44,0:19:29.33,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'm no match for him at all!Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.97,0:19:35.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Franky...Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.90,0:19:37.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Iron Body!Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.78,0:19:39.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Boxing!Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.39,0:19:45.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Shave!Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.20,0:19:51.42,Main,,0,0,0,,What's with your punches?Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.95,0:19:53.33,Captions,,930,0,190,,Hallway in Front of the Pantry Franky vs. FukuroDialogue: 0,0:19:51.42,0:19:53.33,Main,,0,0,0,,You're no ordinary human!Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.68,0:19:57.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if you harden your body to make it like iron,Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.33,0:20:00.47,Main,,0,0,0,,my fists are real iron.Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.48,0:20:05.51,Main,,0,0,0,,N-No!Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.91,0:20:08.39,Main,,0,0,0,,This is no time for having tea!Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.38,0:20:14.90,Captions,,890,0,380,,Kalifa's Room Sanji vs. KalifaDialogue: 0,0:20:10.10,0:20:11.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Witchcraft!Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.10,0:20:13.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I was drawn in by your witchcraft!Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.26,0:20:17.86,Main,,0,0,0,,I almost fell victim to a love trap as dangerous as a storm surge! Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.58,0:20:21.40,Main,,0,0,0,,You've already had three cups.Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.38,0:20:23.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up, witch!Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.78,0:20:25.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna be caught in a trap again!Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.11,0:20:29.87,Main,,0,0,0,,CP9 insulted Robin-chan terribly on the sea train.Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.87,0:20:31.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna forget about it.Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.79,0:20:38.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Now...Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.85,0:20:40.71,Main,,0,0,0,,give me the key!Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.79,0:20:43.12,Main,,0,0,0,,That's too bad...Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.88,0:20:45.74,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems like you're in a hurry.Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.18,0:20:49.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and take the key.Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.57,0:20:52.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Where is it?Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.45,0:20:54.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Well...Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.30,0:20:59.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Where on my body do you think I hid it?Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.75,0:21:02.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try finding it?Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.49,0:21:06.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to!Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.00,0:21:13.16,Main,,0,0,0,,It's looking hopeless for you. Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.16,0:21:16.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm an idiot. Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.08,0:21:18.80,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing: Galaxy 9000  Timing: Galaxy 9000  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Pepperjack  Soundtracking: Halee  Title & Infoboxes: Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll, GaijinDialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HDialogue: 2,0:00:00.17,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 2,0:00:00.21,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:00:00.24,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,hDialogue: 2,0:00:00.28,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 2,0:00:00.31,0:00:01.57,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 2,0:00:00.35,0:00:01.57,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 2,0:00:00.38,0:00:01.73,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 2,0:00:00.42,0:00:01.73,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 2,0:00:00.45,0:00:01.83,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:00:00.49,0:00:01.83,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 3,0:00:01.83,0:00:02.48,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,seDialogue: 3,0:00:01.83,0:00: